  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints : $u=0$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{S}_3=0+\\frac{1}{2} g t^2=\\frac{1}{2} \\times 10 \\times 9=45 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~S}_t \\text { th }=u+(2 t-1) \\frac{g}{2} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~S}_t \\text { th }=0+5(2 t-1)=45 \\\\\n& 2 t-1=9 \\\\\n& t=5 \\mathrm{sec}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
